{"id":"77de281b9ec93c50","group":"90","path":"90/90-prop-creative-complete.md","title":"Creative Set is m-Complete","display":"prop-creative-complete — Creative Set is m-Complete","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-prop-creative-complete","aliases":["90-prop-creative-complete"],"display":"prop-creative-complete — Creative Set is m-Complete","depends_on":["[[90-df-creative-set]]","[[90-df-m-complete]]","[[90-df-program-numbering]]","[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","[[90-lem-parameterized-recursion]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-prop-creative-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-prop-creative-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-creative-complete — Creative Set is m-Complete"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40041a5a5d6a4573\" href=\"?note=40041a5a5d6a4573\" title=\"90-df-creative-set\">90-df-creative-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fcd465e3faf82dc1\" href=\"?note=fcd465e3faf82dc1\" title=\"90-df-m-complete\">90-df-m-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0faa654605ca7e90\" href=\"?note=0faa654605ca7e90\" title=\"90-lem-parameterized-recursion\">90-lem-parameterized-recursion</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(K\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative}\">\\(\\mathrm{Creative}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{mComplete}_{\\mathrm{CE}}\">\\(\\mathrm{mComplete}_{\\mathrm{CE}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"40041a5a5d6a4573\" href=\"?note=40041a5a5d6a4573\" title=\"90-df-creative-set\">90-df-creative-set</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fcd465e3faf82dc1\" href=\"?note=fcd465e3faf82dc1\" title=\"90-df-m-complete\">90-df-m-complete</a>。</li>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a> 的同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a> 的可接受编号；带参数固定点见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0faa654605ca7e90\" href=\"?note=0faa654605ca7e90\" title=\"90-lem-parameterized-recursion\">90-lem-parameterized-recursion</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative}(K)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{mComplete}_{\\mathrm{CE}}(K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Creative}(K)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{mComplete}_{\\mathrm{CE}}(K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>取定义中的全递归生产函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>。任给 c.e. 集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，定义三元部分递归函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(e,n,x)\">\\(F(e,n,x)\\)</span>：先计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(e)\">\\(p(e)\\)</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\ne p(e)\">\\(x\\ne p(e)\\)</span> 则不终止；若相等，则等待 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的枚举中出现，出现时输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。由参数递归引理取得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\">\\(r\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\)</span>，使</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W_{r(n)}=\\begin{cases}\\{p(r(n))\\},&amp;n\\in B,\\\\\\varnothing,&amp;n\\notin B.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W_{r(n)}=\\begin{cases}\\{p(r(n))\\},&amp;n\\in B,\\\\\\varnothing,&amp;n\\notin B.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(n)=p(r(n))\">\\(f(n)=p(r(n))\\)</span>，它全递归。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\notin B\">\\(n\\notin B\\)</span>，空集包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline K\">\\(\\overline K\\)</span>，生产性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(n)\\in\\overline K\">\\(f(n)\\in\\overline K\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in B\">\\(n\\in B\\)</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(n)\\in\\overline K\">\\(f(n)\\in\\overline K\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{r(n)}=\\{f(n)\\}\\subseteq\\overline K\">\\(W_{r(n)}=\\{f(n)\\}\\subseteq\\overline K\\)</span>，生产性又要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(n)\\notin W_{r(n)}\">\\(f(n)\\notin W_{r(n)}\\)</span>，矛盾。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in B\\Longleftrightarrow f(n)\\in K\">\\(n\\in B\\Longleftrightarrow f(n)\\in K\\)</span>；结合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 为 c.e. 即得结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>归约函数必须对全部输入终止，且统一可计算；分别选择一组固定点索引不足以证明多一归约。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 在此仍只是任意给定创造集的变量，不预先等同于某个停机集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-creative-set","status":"resolved","id":"40041a5a5d6a4573","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-creative-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-m-complete","status":"resolved","id":"fcd465e3faf82dc1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-m-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"42029390ebbb59c5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-parameterized-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"0faa654605ca7e90","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-lem-parameterized-recursion]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-creative-set","status":"resolved","id":"40041a5a5d6a4573","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{Creative}$ 和 $\\mathrm{mComplete}_{\\mathrm{CE}}$ 见 [[90-df-creative-set]]、[[90-df-m-complete]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-m-complete","status":"resolved","id":"fcd465e3faf82dc1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{Creative}$ 和 $\\mathrm{mComplete}_{\\mathrm{CE}}$ 见 [[90-df-creative-set]]、[[90-df-m-complete]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[90-df-program-numbering]] 的同一 $W_e$ 及 [[90-lem-program-numbering]] 的可接受编号；带参数固定点见 [[90-lem-parameterized-recursion]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"42029390ebbb59c5","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[90-df-program-numbering]] 的同一 $W_e$ 及 [[90-lem-program-numbering]] 的可接受编号；带参数固定点见 [[90-lem-parameterized-recursion]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-parameterized-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"0faa654605ca7e90","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[90-df-program-numbering]] 的同一 $W_e$ 及 [[90-lem-program-numbering]] 的可接受编号；带参数固定点见 [[90-lem-parameterized-recursion]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Creative}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{mComplete}_{\\mathrm{CE}}","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Creative}(K)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{mComplete}_{\\mathrm{CE}}(K).","display":true},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"F(e,n,x)","display":false},{"tex":"p(e)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\ne p(e)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1","display":false},{"tex":"W_{r(n)}=\\begin{cases}\\{p(r(n))\\},&n\\in B,\\\\\\varnothing,&n\\notin B.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"f(n)=p(r(n))","display":false},{"tex":"n\\notin B","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline K","display":false},{"tex":"f(n)\\in\\overline K","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in B","display":false},{"tex":"f(n)\\in\\overline K","display":false},{"tex":"W_{r(n)}=\\{f(n)\\}\\subseteq\\overline K","display":false},{"tex":"f(n)\\notin W_{r(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in B\\Longleftrightarrow f(n)\\in K","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false}],"bytes":1826,"backlinks":[{"id":"fcd465e3faf82dc1","anchor":"ref-9","l